{"3282600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crowded - A Crow City Builder", "steam_appid": 3282600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would happen if crows evolved like humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Crowded, a cozy avian city builder where you build a society in the sky. As a cunning crow you’ll need every tool at your disposal and plenty of wiles to keep the flock safe, fed and happy. After all, there’s no ‘i’ in Murder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6401d3b5e9aa7bf0cfcbb91d5e4f0d57.poster.avif?t=1788014885\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6401d3b5e9aa7bf0cfcbb91d5e4f0d57.webm?t=1788014885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6401d3b5e9aa7bf0cfcbb91d5e4f0d57.mp4?t=1788014885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for delicious grubs, clay, wood, and other resources to provide for your growing flock. Build your city in the treetops, where every structure is designed with a crow’s way of life in mind. Explore the surrounding landscape, plant new trees to expand your territory, and strategically use the wind to power production and aid transportation. As your civilization evolves through the ages, unlock new technologies adapted to your avian way of life and guide your flock from humble beginnings to a thriving treetop society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/276b6480448fa7d431c19747f0602f0d.poster.avif?t=1788014885\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/276b6480448fa7d431c19747f0602f0d.webm?t=1788014885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/276b6480448fa7d431c19747f0602f0d.mp4?t=1788014885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread your wings, gather your flock, and start building your very own crow civilization!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer </strong>an intricate network of crow nests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge </strong>for resources out in the world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate </strong>the wind for travel and convenience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>a beautiful landscape from the sky!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop</strong> your crow civilization as you progress through the ages!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired </strong>by real life crows, this is a city builder like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6f4c18b12c82b614a42a49bc909cf212.poster.avif?t=1788014885\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6f4c18b12c82b614a42a49bc909cf212.webm?t=1788014885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6f4c18b12c82b614a42a49bc909cf212.mp4?t=1788014885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <